<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets Guangzhou Inv warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets Guangzhou Inv warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Wednesday it has launched 1.1 billion American style call warrants on shares of Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$3.175	    PREMIUM	   18.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.0597	   GEARING	   5.32X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.NOV.97	   MIN EXER LOT    20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	   TO BE DETERMINED  SPOT REFERENCE  HK$3.175</p>
<p> NOTE		GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>		     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
